(
 'Lists the reference log.'
 ''
 'By default the command lists the reflog of HEAD, and just the entries up to the last'
 'checkout. See -branch= for the reflog of a particular branch.'
 ''
 'Reference logs, or "reflogs", record when the tips of branches and other references were'
 'updated in the local repository. Reflogs are useful in various Git commands, to specify'
 'the old value of a reference.'
 ''
 '-all       If you want all records then specify the -all flag.'
 '-branch=   List the reflog of the given branch rather than the one of HEAD.'
 '-max=      If you want a specific number then specify the -max= modifier.'
 '-project=  Use this to specify a particular project with -project=[ProjectName|ProjectFolder]'
)
